                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LUK.5.33+LUK.5.34+LUK.5.35+LUK.5.36+LUK.5.37+LUK.5.38"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Lk 5:33-38",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Nao wanafunzi wake Yohana na Mafarisayo walikuwa wakifunga; basi walikuja, wakamwambia, Kwa nini wanafunzi wa Yohana na wanafunzi wa Mafarisayo hufunga, bali wanafunzi wako hawafungi? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.2.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.2.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 2:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yesu akawaambia, Walioalikwa arusini wawezaje kufunga maadamu bwana arusi yupo pamoja nao? Muda wote walipo na bwana arusi pamoja nao hawawezi kufunga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.2.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.2.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 2:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lakini siku zitakuja watakapoondolewa bwana arusi, ndipo watakapofunga siku ile. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.2.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.2.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 2:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hakuna mtu ashonaye kiraka cha nguo mpya katika vazi kuukuu; akishona, kile kipya kilichotiwa huliharibu lile vazi kuukuu, na pale palipotatuka huzidi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.2.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.2.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 2:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wala hakuna mtu atiaye divai mpya katika viriba vikuukuu; ikiwa atia, ile divai mpya itavipasua viriba vile, divai ikamwagika, vile viriba vikaharibika. Bali hutia divai mpya katika viriba vipya.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.2.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.2.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
